.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH m2dir 1  "m2dir " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
m2dir \- M2dir\-specific API
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBm2dir\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
M2dir\-specific API.
.PP
This command gives you access to the raw m2dir API.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
m2dir\-create(1)
Create the given m2dir folder
.TP
m2dir\-delete(1)
Delete the given m2dir folder
.TP
m2dir\-list(1)
List m2dir folders found under the store root
.TP
m2dir\-messages(1)
Manage M2DIR messages
.TP
m2dir\-flags(1)
Manage M2DIR flags
.TP
m2dir\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
